<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">那抹淡绀漫出了边界 始终</text><text for="L2">任你我之间的时光悬而未决 偶尔拂去沙尘</text><text for="L3">连如何思量 如何看待 都不曾明白</text><text for="L4">想借清晨咬下的那口忧愁 让记忆沉睡</text><text for="L5">该去往何处呢 留下来的勇气</text><text for="L6">是否正在受考验 想从怀疑里学会相信</text><text for="L7">若声音也消失 我便不会起舞</text><text for="L8">连那轮借来未还的夜弦月 也终于放开</text><text for="L9">只凭你的气息 就能越过界限</text><text for="L10">对藩篱与秩序的依赖 因你而化作水</text><text for="L11">我只顾追逐那无色的光芒</text><text for="L12">愿这惦念彼此距离的心事 只落在我一人身上</text><text for="L13">小舟顺流漂去 不再用力 只朝有光处</text><text for="L14">对着鲜艳的果实吐出恶言</text><text for="L15">又添上刚学会的谎</text><text for="L16">把一切吞尽 才勉强站稳</text><text for="L17">若我不再是那个说着怪话的自己</text><text for="L18">便会困进与谁都无从相交的那一类</text><text for="L19">把你推远 再将伤口剜深</text><text for="L20">心已磨薄 歌却还要唱下去</text><text for="L21">若你笑了 我也试着笑一笑</text><text for="L22">只凭你的气息 就能越过界限</text><text for="L23">对藩篱与秩序的依赖 因你而化作水</text><text for="L24">我只顾追逐那无色的光芒</text><text for="L25">愿这惦念彼此距离的心事 只落在我一人身上</text><text for="L26">小舟顺流漂去 不再用力 只朝有光处</text><text for="L27">黑醋栗色的发丝轻轻摇曳</text><text for="L28">还在哭 哭得喉咙都已干涩</text><text for="L29">关于你 请让我再讲讲那段尚在半途的故事</text><text for="L30">活着究竟要向谁 又向什么求一声准许</text><text for="L31">心里的感受 难道非要一个名字不可</text><text for="L32">啊 话还说不尽 此刻就先留着这句未尽之言</text><text for="L33">哪怕只用一句漂亮话也好</text><text for="L34">哪怕只碰到一瞬 便无法止于憧憬</text><text for="L35">我只顾追逐那无色的光芒</text><text for="L36">愿那首忍不住试探的歌 别传到你耳畔</text><text for="L37">小舟顺流漂去 不再用力 只朝有光处</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Kimigaite Mizuninaru"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ZUTOMAYO"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Tadashii Itsuwarikarano Kishou - EP"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1440134065"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPPO01805182"/></metadata></head><body><div begin="0:29.132" end="4:12.856"><p begin="0:29.132" end="0:33.149" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:29.132" end="0:29.292">は</span><span begin="0:29.292" end="0:29.612">み</span><span begin="0:29.612" end="0:29.853">出</span><span begin="0:29.853" end="0:30.133">して</span><span begin="0:30.133" end="0:30.733">た</span> <span begin="0:30.822" end="0:31.214">淡</span><span begin="0:31.214" end="0:31.355">い</span><span begin="0:31.355" end="0:32.188">紺色</span><span begin="0:32.188" end="0:32.436">が</span><span begin="0:32.436" end="0:33.149">ずっと</span></p><p begin="0:34.058" end="0:40.667" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:34.058" end="0:34.471">僕</span><span begin="0:34.471" end="0:34.619">ら</span><span begin="0:34.619" end="0:34.839">の</span><span begin="0:34.839" end="0:35.344">時間</span><span begin="0:35.344" end="0:35.680">を</span><span begin="0:35.680" end="0:36.081">解</span><span begin="0:36.081" end="0:36.710">決</span><span begin="0:37.315" end="0:37.843">させず</span><span begin="0:37.843" end="0:38.124">に</span> <span begin="0:38.124" end="0:38.472">砂</span><span begin="0:38.472" end="0:38.656">を</span><span begin="0:38.656" end="0:39.225">払</span><span begin="0:39.225" end="0:39.325">っ</span><span begin="0:39.325" end="0:40.055">た</span><span begin="0:40.055" end="0:40.247">り</span><span begin="0:40.247" end="0:40.367">し</span><span begin="0:40.367" end="0:40.667">た</span></p><p begin="0:42.181" end="0:46.135" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:42.181" end="0:42.951">考え</span><span begin="0:42.951" end="0:43.092">と</span><span begin="0:43.092" end="0:43.692">か</span><span begin="0:43.773" end="0:44.145">捉</span><span begin="0:44.145" end="0:44.313">え</span><span begin="0:44.313" end="0:44.754">方</span><span begin="0:44.754" end="0:44.974">も</span><span begin="0:44.974" end="0:45.835">知らない</span><span begin="0:45.835" end="0:46.135">や</span></p><p begin="0:47.017" end="0:52.596" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:47.017" end="0:47.437">朝</span><span begin="0:47.437" end="0:47.578">に</span><span begin="0:47.578" end="0:48.098">齧</span><span begin="0:48.098" end="0:48.239">っ</span><span begin="0:48.239" end="0:48.455">た</span><span begin="0:48.455" end="0:48.959">憂</span><span begin="0:48.959" end="0:49.060">い</span><span begin="0:49.060" end="0:49.660">で</span> <span begin="0:50.261" end="0:50.682">記</span><span begin="0:50.682" end="0:51.094">憶を</span><span begin="0:51.094" end="0:51.483">眠</span><span begin="0:51.483" end="0:51.643">ら</span><span begin="0:51.643" end="0:52.184">せた</span><span begin="0:52.184" end="0:52.296">く</span><span begin="0:52.296" end="0:52.596">て</span></p><p begin="0:54.307" end="0:59.687" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:54.307" end="0:55.088">どこか</span><span begin="0:55.088" end="0:55.288">に</span><span begin="0:55.288" end="0:55.921">ゆく</span><span begin="0:55.921" end="0:56.089">の</span><span begin="0:56.089" end="0:56.689">か</span> <span begin="0:57.532" end="0:58.013">留</span><span begin="0:58.013" end="0:58.313">ま</span><span begin="0:58.313" end="0:58.514">る</span><span begin="0:58.514" end="0:59.114">勇</span><span begin="0:59.154" end="0:59.387">気</span><span begin="0:59.387" end="0:59.687">が</span></p><p begin="1:00.789" end="1:06.850" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.789" end="1:01.289">試</span><span begin="1:01.289" end="1:01.578">さ</span><span begin="1:01.578" end="1:01.758">れ</span><span begin="1:01.758" end="1:02.411">てる</span><span begin="1:02.411" end="1:02.579">の</span><span begin="1:02.579" end="1:03.179">か</span> <span begin="1:03.228" end="1:04.021">疑う</span><span begin="1:04.021" end="1:04.201">こ</span><span begin="1:04.201" end="1:04.622">と</span><span begin="1:04.622" end="1:04.822">で</span><span begin="1:04.822" end="1:05.243">信</span><span begin="1:05.243" end="1:05.359">じた</span><span begin="1:05.359" end="1:06.850">い</span></p><p begin="1:07.313" end="1:12.593" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.313" end="1:08.066">踊り</span><span begin="1:08.066" end="1:08.247">は</span><span begin="1:08.247" end="1:09.108">しない</span><span begin="1:09.108" end="1:09.708">さ</span> <span begin="1:10.507" end="1:11.004">音</span><span begin="1:11.004" end="1:11.312">も</span><span begin="1:11.312" end="1:12.593">無くなれば</span></p><p begin="1:13.747" end="1:19.060" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.747" end="1:14.168">手</span><span begin="1:14.168" end="1:14.316">放</span><span begin="1:14.316" end="1:14.608">せ</span><span begin="1:14.608" end="1:15.029">た</span> <span begin="1:15.029" end="1:15.157">借</span><span begin="1:15.157" end="1:15.397">り</span><span begin="1:15.397" end="1:15.538">パ</span><span begin="1:15.538" end="1:15.798">ク</span><span begin="1:15.798" end="1:15.938">し</span><span begin="1:15.938" end="1:16.218">て</span><span begin="1:16.218" end="1:16.639">た</span> <span begin="1:16.639" end="1:16.791">夜</span><span begin="1:16.791" end="1:17.200">弦</span><span begin="1:17.200" end="1:17.440">の</span><span begin="1:17.440" end="1:17.881">月</span><span begin="1:17.881" end="1:19.060">も</span></p><p begin="1:19.423" end="1:22.595" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.423" end="1:19.771">気</span><span begin="1:19.771" end="1:19.875">配</span><span begin="1:19.875" end="1:20.276">だけ</span><span begin="1:20.276" end="1:20.424">で</span><span begin="1:20.424" end="1:20.684">超え</span><span begin="1:20.684" end="1:20.845">ら</span><span begin="1:20.845" end="1:21.105">れ</span><span begin="1:21.105" end="1:21.265">る</span><span begin="1:21.265" end="1:21.565">か</span><span begin="1:21.565" end="1:22.595">ら</span></p><p begin="1:23.668" end="1:29.543" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.668" end="1:24.268">柵</span><span begi