nd="1:44.339">の抜</span><span begin="1:44.339" end="1:44.679">けた</span><span begin="1:44.679" end="1:45.660">光る方</span><span begin="1:45.660" end="1:46.795">へ</span></p><p begin="2:00.009" end="2:03.125" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:00.009" end="2:00.902">鮮やかな</span><span begin="2:00.902" end="2:01.643">フルーツ</span><span begin="2:01.643" end="2:01.775">に</span><span begin="2:01.775" end="2:02.284">毒</span><span begin="2:02.284" end="2:02.384">を</span><span begin="2:02.384" end="2:03.125">吐いて</span></p><p begin="2:03.385" end="2:06.389" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:03.385" end="2:03.706">習</span><span begin="2:03.706" end="2:03.806">っ</span><span begin="2:03.806" end="2:04.066">た</span><span begin="2:04.066" end="2:04.206">ば</span><span begin="2:04.206" end="2:04.507">か</span><span begin="2:04.507" end="2:04.703">りの</span><span begin="2:04.703" end="2:05.156">嘘</span><span begin="2:05.156" end="2:05.408">を</span><span begin="2:05.408" end="2:05.989">挟</span><span begin="2:05.989" end="2:06.089">ん</span><span begin="2:06.089" end="2:06.389">で</span></p><p begin="2:06.491" end="2:10.027" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:06.491" end="2:07.432">食べ尽くす</span><span begin="2:07.432" end="2:07.833">こと</span><span begin="2:07.833" end="2:08.381">で ど</span><span begin="2:08.381" end="2:08.494">う</span><span begin="2:08.494" end="2:08.654">に</span><span begin="2:08.654" end="2:08.914">か</span><span begin="2:08.914" end="2:10.027">立っている</span></p><p begin="2:10.156" end="2:12.907" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:10.156" end="2:10.548">変</span><span begin="2:10.548" end="2:10.708">な</span><span begin="2:10.708" end="2:11.349">言葉</span><span begin="2:11.349" end="2:11.646">使</span><span begin="2:11.646" end="2:11.758">う</span><span begin="2:11.758" end="2:12.186">僕で</span><span begin="2:12.186" end="2:12.299">い</span><span begin="2:12.299" end="2:12.907">なきゃ</span></p><p begin="2:13.000" end="2:16.123" itunes:key="L18" 